# Beacon · Fictional Product Context for AI Product Management Practice

> **Class-use disclaimer:** Beacon is a fictional internal clinical AI platform designed to make approved AI capabilities easier to deliver, discover, and use through a consistent product experience. For this course project, all product names, teams, people, dates, documents, metrics, and examples have been fictionalized or invented. The scenarios are designed to simulate realistic product-management work—such as maintaining requirements, configuration, product decisions, design artifacts, and stakeholder materials—without representing any real organization or internal product.

